p The Nitrous platform engineering and devops team works on the infrastructure and tools that power our cutting-edge cloud development platform.

p We're looking for talented engineers who are passionate about building fault-tolerant distributed systems, automating configuration and deployment, and bringing about a level of security to our deployment process which enables our application teams to deploy features quickly and consistently.

h3 Responsibilities

ul
  li Implement internal tools such as monitoring, analytics and automated backup in the form of services
  li Be responsible for the uptime of customer-facing services
  li Design and lead infrastructure failure simulations and implement corrective measures
  li Benchmark app performance and design scalable and performant systems and APIs

h3 Technologies

ul
  li Go, Bash, Ruby
  li Docker
  li Amazon Web Services
  li Chef, Puppet
  li Vagrant
  li RabbitMQ, AMQP
  li PostgreSQL, Redis, Memcache
  li Nginx, HAProxy
  li Monit, Nagios, Sensu
  li Collectd, Statsd, Diamond, Riemann
  li Graphite, Logstash
  li Git

h4 To apply, please provide the following:

ul
  li Resume
  li Github Profile
  li Links to side/hobby projects that you have built